OL,3,GNEWSA#50m council cuts will impact NHS,
OL,4,Asays hospital chair
OL,5,
OL,6,FA North West hospital chair has
OL,7,Fexpressed concerns over council plans
OL,8,Ffor a further #50m in cuts.
OL,10,FWarrington Hospital chair and former
OL,11,FConservative MP Andy Carter has written
OL,12,Fto leaders at Warrington Borough
OL,13,FCouncil outlining fears that proposed
OL,14,Fcuts would have an unintended but
OL,15,Fharmful effect on the hospital's
OL,16,Falready busy emergency department.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
