OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSA#50m council cuts will impact NHS,
OL,4,Asays hospital chair
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe proposals include a further #51.2
OL,7,Fmillion of cuts and savings - taking
OL,8,Fthe current total savings proposed to
OL,9,Faround #90 million, and Carter
OL,10,Fhighlighted adult social care stood to
OL,11,Fshoulder a significant portion of the
OL,12,Fspending reductions.
OL,14,FCouncil finance cabinet member Denis
OL,15,FMatthews told BBC Radio Merseyside
OL,16,Fthere were "risks in every decision
OL,17,Fthat the council takes," but said the
OL,18,Fcouncil would "be prepared to work with
OL,19,Fthe NHS at every stage to ensure that
OL,20,Fpatients and residents receive the very
OL,21,Fbest possible care possible within the
OL,22,Fbudgets there".
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
